  "body": "Fixed Price House & Land package offers a great opportunity to secure a modern home in the rapidly growing Ara Hills community. \r\nThe 160m² design has been carefully planned to deliver a practical and comfortable layout, appealing to families, first-home buyers, and investors alike.\r\n\r\nHome Features\r\n•\t4 double bedrooms\r\n•\tMaster bedroom with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite\r\n•\tOpen-plan kitchen, dining, and living area\r\n•\tKitchen with island bench and quality fittings\r\n•\tInternal access garage\r\n•\tSeamless indoor–outdoor flow for entertaining\r\n\r\nLocation Highlights\r\n•\tPositioned within the Orewa / Silverdale growth corridor\r\n•\tClose to beaches, schools, and local amenities\r\n•\tEasy motorway access to Auckland CBD\r\n•\tLocated in a master-planned community\r\n\r\nKey Benefits\r\n•\tBrand new, low-maintenance home\r\n•\tFixed pricing for cost certainty\r\n•\tAbility to customise specifications\r\n•\tLocated in a high-demand growth area\r\n\r\nOr check out or website http://www.navigationhomes.co.nz We look forward to hearing from you!",
